                    downloaded ruleset: kagerou-main-2026-09-02\n                        </span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"log-row grid grid-cols-[186px_54px_minmax(0,1fr)] items-baseline gap-x-4 text-[13px] leading-[1.55]\" data-dynamic=\"true\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-1-26\" data-name=\"log row container\" data-reason=\"visibility toggled by search filter\">\n                        <span class=\"whitespace-nowrap text-[var(--quiet)]\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-1-26-1\">\n                            2026-09-02 19:17:26.814\n                        </span>\n                        <span class=\"font-medium text-[var(--warn)]\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-1-26-2\">\n                            WARN\n                        </span>\n                        <span class=\"log-message min-w-0 break-words text-[var(--body)]\" data-dynamic=\"true\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-1-26-3\" data-name=\"log message text\" data-reason=\"innerHTML replaced to highlight search matches\">\n                            stale subscription metadata; refresh due in 12h\n                        </span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"log-row grid grid-cols-[186px_54px_minmax(0,1fr)] items-baseline gap-x-4 text-[13px] leading-[1.55]\" data-dynamic=\"true\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-1-27\" data-name=\"log row container\" data-reason=\"visibility toggled by search filter\">\n                        <span class=\"whitespace-nowrap text-[var(--quiet)]\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-1-27-1\">\n                            2026-09-02 19:17:28.102\n                        </span>\n                        <span class=\"font-medium text-[#aaa2bd]\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-1-27-2\">\n                            INFO\n                        </span>\n                        <span class=\"log-message min-w-0 break-words text-[var(--body)]\" data-dynamic=\"true\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-1-27-3\" data-name=\"log message text\" data-reason=\"innerHTML replaced to highlight search matches\">\n    